  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following postfix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`9 4 - 7 * 6 +`",
        "zh": "如果下方所有数字都是一位数,请计算下方后缀表达式:\n\n`9 4 - 7 * 6 +`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "21",
            "zh": "21"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "34",
            "zh": "34"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "41",
            "zh": "41"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "47",
            "zh": "47"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "51",
            "zh": "51"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\n9 4 − 7 * 6 + is evaluated by looking for 2 numbers followed by an operator from left to right. Therefore,\n\n`9 4 - 7 * 6 +`\n\n= (((9 4 −) 7 *) 6 +) = (5 * 7) + 6 = 41",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n从左到右扫描。遇到减号时，右操作数是最后读到的 4，左操作数是 9，所以得 $9-4=5$。接着算 $5\\times7=35$，最后加 6 得 41。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
