    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following prefix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`/ + + * 2 4 6 * - 8 1 + 3 5 - 9 7`",
        "zh": "如果下方所有数字都是一位数,请计算下方前缀表达式:\n\n`/ + + * 2 4 6 * - 8 1 + 3 5 - 9 7`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "28",
            "zh": "28"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "34",
            "zh": "34"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "35",
            "zh": "35"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "36",
            "zh": "36"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "84",
            "zh": "84"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nGroup each operator with its two operands:\n\n```text\n/ (+ (+ (* 2 4) 6) (* (- 8 1) (+ 3 5))) (- 9 7)\n= / (+ (+ 8 6) (* 7 8)) 2\n= / (+ 14 56) 2\n= / 70 2\n= 35\n```",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n外层除法的分母是 $9-7=2$。分子由两段相加：$2\\times4+6=14$，$(8-1)(3+5)=56$。所以 $(14+56)/2=35$。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
