    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to prefix:\n\n$$\n\\frac{8(7+5)-4^{2}*6}{9-2^{3}}\n$$",
        "zh": "请将下方中缀表达式转换为前缀表达式:\n\n$$\n\\frac{8(7+5)-4^{2}*6}{9-2^{3}}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/-*8+75*^246-9^32`",
            "zh": "`/-*8+75*^246-9^32`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`-/*8+75*^426-9^23`",
            "zh": "`-/*8+75*^426-9^23`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/-*+758*6^42-9^23`",
            "zh": "`/-*+758*6^42-9^23`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/-*8+75*^426-9^23`",
            "zh": "`/-*8+75*^426-9^23`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`-/8*+75*^426-9^23`",
            "zh": "`-/8*+75*^426-9^23`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "$$\\frac{8(7+5)-4^2\\cdot6}{9-2^3}$$\n\n```text\nNumerator: - (* 8 (+ 7 5)) (* (^ 4 2) 6)\nDenominator: - 9 (^ 2 3)\nPrefix: / - * 8 + 7 5 * ^ 4 2 6 - 9 ^ 2 3\n```\n\nSource correction: the final unparenthesized expression in the original solution swaps the first subtraction and multiplication operators. The correct expression matches option D.",
        "zh": "答案：**D**。\n\n分数的外层为除法。分子两个乘积相减，写成 `- * 8 + 7 5 * ^ 4 2 6`；分母写成 `- 9 ^ 2 3`。在两者前加除号。原解析去掉括号时颠倒了分子开头的减号和乘号，应先写减号。"
      },
      "source": {
