    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to postfix:\n\n(7 * 2 ^ 3 − 9 * 6 + 8 / 4) ^ (7 − 2 * 3)",
        "zh": "请将下方中缀表达式转换为后缀表达式:\n\n(7 * 2 ^ 3 − 9 * 6 + 8 / 4) ^ (7 − 2 * 3)"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`7*23^96*-8/4+72*3-^`",
            "zh": "`7*23^96*-8/4+72*3-^`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`723^*96*-84/+723*-^`",
            "zh": "`723^*96*-84/+723*-^`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`23^7*69*-84/+23*7-^`",
            "zh": "`23^7*69*-84/+23*7-^`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`723^*9684*-/+723*-^`",
            "zh": "`723^*9684*-/+723*-^`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`723^*96*84/-+723*-^`",
            "zh": "`723^*96*84/-+723*-^`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\nConvert each operand of the outer exponent separately, preserving operand order, then place ^ last.\n\n```text\nLeft operand: + (- (* 7 (^ 2 3)) (* 9 6)) (/ 8 4)\nRight operand: - 7 (* 2 3)\nPostfix: 7 2 3 ^ * 9 6 * - 8 4 / + 7 2 3 * - ^\n```",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n整个式子是乘方，先写底数的后缀 `7 2 3 ^ * 9 6 * - 8 4 / +`。其中乘方和乘除先处理，加减从左往右。指数 $7-2\\times3$ 写成 `7 2 3 * -`。按底数、指数、乘方符号的顺序连接。"
      },
