      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Which of the following have the same value? Choices a and b are in postfix notation and c and d are in prefix notation.\n\na. `4 3 + 2 *`\n\nb. `4 3 2 + *`\n\nc. `+ * 4 3 2`\n\nd. `+ 4 * 3 2`",
        "zh": "以下哪些表达式的值相同？a、b 为后缀表达式，c、d 为前缀表达式。\n\na. `4 3 + 2 *`\n\nb. `4 3 2 + *`\n\nc. `+ * 4 3 2`\n\nd. `+ 4 * 3 2`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "a, b",
            "zh": "a, b"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
