            "zh": "b, d"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "a, d",
            "zh": "a, d"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "b, c",
            "zh": "b, c"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "a, c",
            "zh": "a, c"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **E**.\n\n- a. $(4+3)\\cdot2=14$\n- b. $4\\cdot(3+2)=20$\n- c. $(4\\cdot3)+2=14$\n- d. $4+(3\\cdot2)=10$\n\nBoth a and c equal 14. Source correction: the original c calculation says “+4”; the expression requires “+2”.",
        "zh": "答案：**E**。\n\n按每个表达式自己的括号求值。a 得 $(4+3)\\times2=14$；b 得 $4\\times(3+2)=20$；c 得 $4\\times3+2=14$；d 得 $4+3\\times2=10$。只有 a、c 相等。原解析 c 的最后加数误写为 4，题面是 2。"
      },
